      "svg": "<svg viewBox='0 0 1100 1100'><rect x='0' y='0' width='1100' height='1100' fill='#1a1a2e'/><text x='550' y='75' text-anchor='middle' font-size='27' fill='#ffd700'>Amazon's Flywheel vs Blockbuster's Loop</text><circle cx='550' cy='330' r='190' fill='none' stroke='#10b981' stroke-width='4'/><text x='550' y='230' text-anchor='middle' font-size='17' fill='#ffffff'>Lower Prices</text><text x='790' y='330' text-anchor='middle' font-size='17' fill='#ffffff'>More Sellers</text><text x='550' y='440' text-anchor='middle' font-size='17' fill='#ffffff'>More Volume</text><text x='320' y='330' text-anchor='middle' font-size='17' fill='#ffffff'>More Customers</text><path d='M 640 200 A 190 190 0 0 1 730 260' fill='none' stroke='#0ea5e9' stroke-width='5'/><text x='550' y='560' text-anchor='middle' font-size='15' fill='#888'>Tech (recs, automation, cloud) pushes this wheel faster</text><rect x='150' y='650' width='800' height='4' fill='#888'/><line x1='200' y1='720' x2='320' y2='760' stroke='#ef4444' stroke-width='4'/><line x1='320' y1='760' x2='420' y2='710' stroke='#ef4444' stroke-width='4'/><line x1='420' y1='710' x2='560' y2='770' stroke='#ef4444' stroke-width='4'/><line x1='560' y1='770' x2='680' y2='715' stroke='#ef4444' stroke-width='4'/><line x1='680' y1='715' x2='820' y2='775' stroke='#ef4444' stroke-width='4'/><text x='230' y='700' font-size='14' fill='#ffffff'>Partner</text><text x='430' y='695' font-size='14' fill='#ffffff'>In-house</text><text x='670' y='700' font-size='14' fill='#ffffff'>Late streaming</text><text x='550' y='840' text-anchor='middle' font-size='16' fill='#888'>Blockbuster: a new direction every attempt, no compounding</text></svg>",
